        <mxCell id="v74" value="&lt;b&gt;Why this flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The locality check produces evidence, never a verdict: all three outcomes create a request for a human. Only an unusable invitation code stops the flow, and the applicant can retry. The decision is applied only while the request is still undecided, so a second moderator or a withdrawal cannot be overwritten. The applicant's answer to an information request is drawn in sequence (g) and SSD-A4." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFDF2;strokeColor=#B8A660;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#33404D;" vertex="1" parent="1">
